{"game": "elden-ring-nightreign", "language": "english", "appid": 2622380, "month": "2026-03", "window": 4, "start_date": 1774310400, "end_date": 1775001599, "month_true_total": 1178, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-04 23:47:25 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "222216652", "author": {"steamid": "76561198411012668", "personaname": "Eris", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198411012668/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 29, "playtime_forever": 13511, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 13511, "last_played": 1771359954, "avatar": "35f0ac6aa6daa979b9365963d9774f0996edb3d9"}, "language": "english", "review": "Equally as good as frustrating.\r\nPlease, I beg you, Fromsoft, throw the relic system in the trash.\r\n\r\nFromsoft used a gacha-like system to get relics (character upgrades) which is an incredibly annoying system that's supposed to rip off players. The most confusing thing is that this system is used with ingame currency, so it's both annoying but also doesn't scam us ??? I'd argue a regular gacha is less annoying, because in NR, the loot rolled are relics which can have one of millions of combinations.\r\nThe deep relics make this system even more frustrating; they effectively limit the pool of usable relics even more (because some of their effects are nearly unplayable on certain character builds).\r\nI thought I'd be able to deal with this by simply keepiong all of them and using the filter system to equip the ones I want, but there's a relic number cap, so it's necessary to micromanage all of the useless ones. I haven't heard of a single person who enjoys this.\r\n\r\nAnother huge flaw is the DLC map. It's incredibly hard to learn and most of the time, an unfamiliar player gets lost and takes more than 10 minutes to rejoin the team, leaving the two teammates alone against bosses scaled for 3 players. I wish it was possible to turn off the DLC map features and events (the Balancers event is incredibly frustrating).", "timestamp_created": 1775001489, "timestamp_updated": 1775001489, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1748555952", "hardware": {"system_ram": "16251", "os": "Windows 11", "cpu_name": "Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-10300H CPU @ 2.50GHz", "adapter_description": "NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1650 Ti", "vram_size": 3935}, "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "222214746", "author": {"steamid": "76561198204708499", "personaname": "Bill Gates", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/choppaent/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 13, "playtime_forever": 3556, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 584, "last_played": 1788484933, "avatar": "c566d399fa0b2a558e4a514b750e16ace17185c4"}, "language": "english", "review": "whichever idiots idea it was to not add voice chat deserves to tarred and feathered and blacklisted from working in the video game industry for life or better yet just throw them in the brazen bull", "timestamp_created": 1774999074, "timestamp_updated": 1774999074, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.472440958023071289", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1748555952", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "222208926", "author": {"steamid": "76561197974780584", "personaname": "RedWorld", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197974780584/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 20, "playtime_forever": 4386, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3932, "last_played": 1775442111, "avatar": "82d6d13f0b5c48814afa69a0e3